# Grauberg - Dominion Op #10 (abyssea 187, op 597), kill credit: main and bob (a party) and cid (alone), level 99
# Warriors in Abyssea - Grauberg; the op's onMobDeath runs for each member of the killer's alliance in the zone
# (luautils::OnMobDeath, optParams.isKiller true for the killer only), and the handler reads no optParams. Bob and cid
# accepted (a GM), main not: main kills a Glen_Crab: main (the killer, available) nothing; bob (not the killer): Prog 1;
# cid (not in the party): nothing. Main accepted (a GM): bob kills one: bob Prog 2, main (not the killer) Prog 1, cid
# nothing. One dead with no killer (nokiller): the lookup's handlers get no player: nothing for anyone. Cid kills one:
# cid Prog 1; main and bob (another party) nothing. Perfect Dodge, Invincible and Elemental Sforzo (GM effects) keep the
# chars alive through the kills (the Abyssea mobs aggro and link).
lists AbysseaGrauberg/Glen_Crab/onMobDeath
char zone=AbysseaGrauberg pos=-555,31,-760 job=WAR lvl=99
char bob zone=AbysseaGrauberg pos=-555,31,-758 job=WAR lvl=99
char cid zone=AbysseaGrauberg pos=-555,31,-756 job=WAR lvl=99
login
effect 49                               # a GM: Perfect Dodge (melee hits evaded)
effect 50                               # a GM: Invincible (no physical damage)
effect 522                              # a GM: Elemental Sforzo (no magic damage)
bob: login
bob: effect 49                          # a GM: Perfect Dodge (melee hits evaded)
bob: effect 50                          # a GM: Invincible (no physical damage)
bob: effect 522                         # a GM: Elemental Sforzo (no magic damage)
cid: login
cid: effect 49                          # a GM: Perfect Dodge (melee hits evaded)
cid: effect 50                          # a GM: Invincible (no physical damage)
cid: effect 522                         # a GM: Elemental Sforzo (no magic damage)
invite bob
bob: accept
bob: quest Abyssea.DominionOp10Grauberg accepted # a GM
cid: quest Abyssea.DominionOp10Grauberg accepted # a GM
kill IRONCLAD_SUNDERER-360              # main the killer: bob Prog 1 (17817681)
quest Abyssea.DominionOp10Grauberg accepted # a GM
bob: kill IRONCLAD_SUNDERER-359         # bob Prog 2, main Prog 1 (17817682)
kill IRONCLAD_SUNDERER-358 nokiller     # no killer: nothing (17817683)
cid: kill IRONCLAD_SUNDERER-357         # cid Prog 1 (17817684)
